# stow ignore list for the wallpapers package.
#
# NOTE: this file REPLACES stow's built-in defaults, so the standard entries are
# repeated below.
#
# Nothing consumes a STOWED copy of this package. The Plash shaders are dragged
# in from the repo path directly (INSTALL.md), and the wallpaper scripts read
# ~/Pictures/Wallpapers, which is a real directory outside the repo. Stowing to
# $HOME would only create a stray ~/shaders symlink.
^/shaders

# --- stow defaults, preserved ---
RCS
.+,v
CVS
\.\#.+
\.cvsignore
\.svn
_darcs
\.hg
\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules
.+~
\#.*\#
^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING
